{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"elf_tree_platform","model_identifier":"elf_tree_platform","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# elf_tree_platform\n\nElf tree platform: a ring deck built round a great trunk (trunk section included, 53 u across), carried on curved brackets, with a rail and a spiral of steps up the trunk.\n\n- Footprint: 12 x 12 columns (192 x 192 units, 5.40 x 5.40 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -80..80, y 0..260, z -80..80 units.\n- Texture: 256 x 512, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 48, construction_0 6, construction_33 14, construction_66 47, ruined 12 (0 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- trunk: 56 x 260 x 56 centred at the origin\n- deck: 160 x 18 x 160 ring at y 160 (walkable)\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `elf_tree_platform_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `elf_tree_platform_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_elf_tree_platform` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_platform_1` at (-56, 164, -56)\n- `slot_platform_2` at (56, 164, -56)\n- `slot_platform_3` at (-56, 164, 56)\n- `slot_platform_4` at (56, 164, 56)\n"},"resolution":{"width":256,"height":512},"elements":[{"name":"trunk_a","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-27.0,0.0,-11.34],"to":[27.0,260.0,11.34],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0.0,0.0,54.0,260.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[98.66,0.0,121.34,260.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0.0,0.0,54.0,260.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[98.66,0.0,121.34,260.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0.0,360.66,54.0,383.34],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0.0,360.66,54.0,383.34],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"748a38ad-1b63-5c01-9a54-1754660e738b"},{"name":"trunk_b","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-11.34,0.0,-27.0],"to":[11.34,260.0,27.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[98.66,0.0,121.34,260.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0.0,0.0,54.0,260.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[98.66,0.0,121.34,260.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0.0,0.0,54.0,260.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[230.66,0.0,253.34,54.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[230.66,0.0,253.34,54.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"a71d36ba-9eec-507c-8fd8-0a9dcb755976"},{"name":"trunk_c","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-21.06,0.0,-21.06],"to":[21.06,260.0,21.06],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[54.94,0.0,97.06,260.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[54.94,0.0,97.06,260.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[54.94,0.0,97.06,260.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[54.94,0.0,97.06,260.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[160.94,310.94,203.06,353.06],"text